title: "aiWT: machine-learning-augmented Wang-Teter kinetic energy density functional"
abstract: >-
  Implementation of a Wang-Teter kinetic energy density functional whose kernel
  parameter is learned from electron-density data, for use in orbital-free
  density functional theory calculations.
